    text: "Beginning at 5:00 PM, the Counterclockwise HOP buses will not be able to access the stops at Euclid 18th or on Colorado Ave., due to the closure of Colorado for the Homecoming Parade. It turns out that we are not able to service Euclid 18th, contrary to what we were told to expect."
